*> vybe-test: cobol/redefines_extended/redefines_numeric_and_alpha_roundtrip
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_redefines_extended.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BUFFER PIC X(4) VALUE "0000".
01 WS-NUMBER REDEFINES WS-BUFFER PIC 9(4).
01 WS-NEXT PIC X(2) VALUE "AA".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE 77 TO WS-NUMBER.
    DISPLAY WS-BUFFER.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-BUFFER DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "0077"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [0077] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    MOVE WS-BUFFER TO WS-NEXT.
    DISPLAY WS-NEXT.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-NEXT DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "00"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [00] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

